Natsuki
Re: I'm sorry.
1 attached file

334
00:21:02,094 --> 00:21:02,644
Retrieving

335
00:21:09,294 --> 00:21:12,854
Natsumi... You've still got the strap.

336
00:21:15,234 --> 00:21:16,534
Yukino!

337
00:21:20,804 --> 00:21:25,714
Yukino. I'm so sorry about
what I said earlier. I uh...

338
00:21:28,014 --> 00:21:29,344
I have mine too.

339
00:21:37,294 --> 00:21:40,624
I've kept mine all this time, too.

340
00:21:42,164 --> 00:21:43,294
Yukino...

341
00:21:47,864 --> 00:21:50,064
I've kept mine, too.

342
00:21:55,914 --> 00:22:00,344
Ms. Sayaka and Ms. Chitose,
have you ever quarreled?

343
00:22:00,844 --> 00:22:01,944
What?

344
00:22:02,054 --> 00:22:05,714
I can't even begin to count the
number of times we quarreled.

345
00:22:05,954 --> 00:22:07,784
Oh? Is that so?

346
00:22:07,954 --> 00:22:12,224
Just think of all the times we didn't
speak to each other for a while.

347
00:22:12,564 --> 00:22:15,224
I guess you're right. There were such times.

348
00:22:15,934 --> 00:22:18,954
But you are best friends.

349
00:22:20,434 --> 00:22:22,164
Natsuki, smile!

350
00:22:22,704 --> 00:22:25,194
Oh come on, you're embarrassing me.

351
00:22:26,474 --> 00:22:27,734
Wow!

352
00:22:33,884 --> 00:22:36,744
The fireworks are beautiful.

353
00:22:38,254 --> 00:22:41,154
Okay, today, ninety points! Go ahead, take it!

354
00:22:43,424 --> 00:22:46,584
The fireworks. They're beautiful, aren't they?

355
00:22:46,664 --> 00:22:49,564
What's this?! You're letting the
summer festival comfort you?!

356
00:22:49,634 --> 00:22:52,124
That's not right. Negative two hundred
points for you, Dobato!

357
00:22:52,404 --> 00:22:55,234
The fireworks are beautiful, don't you think?

358
00:22:55,234 --> 00:22:57,504
Hey! Did you hear what I said?!

359
00:22:57,634 --> 00:22:59,664
They're beautiful.

360
00:23:01,374 --> 00:23:09,014
Everyone dreams of flying

361
